          <div class="carousel-header">
            <div class="carousel-title"><%= ['🔄 Anda Mungkin Terlepas Xxx','🔄 You Might\'ve Missed Xx','🔄 Jangan Ketinggalan Xxx','🔄 Don\'t Miss These Xx','🔄 Untuk Anda Tonton Xxx'][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)] %></div>
